// The standard library: the components an application is built from, the
// event payloads they emit, and the supporting types -- `Style`, the style
// enums, `Alert`, `File`, `Test`, `error`, and the `i18n` and `html`
// namespaces.
//
// Nothing here is in scope until it is imported. `import . "sngl://std"`
// writes its declarations unqualified; `import <alias> "sngl://std"` qualifies
// them, and is also how a platform overrides a component (`component
// <alias>.vbox`).
